{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065322/block/singleImage/3275925/wm/01M84EGMQDJ7MYP2EJVK99V63V.jpeg?updatedAt=1795445857\"/><figcaption>YOHO West本月錄得5宗二手買賣，較上月同期17宗大減七成，平均實用呎價約13,258元。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產天水圍副區域營業董事伍耀祖表示，天水圍新晉屋苑 YOHO West 本月錄得 5 宗二手買賣，較上月同期 17 宗大減七成，平均實用呎價約 13,258 元。 伍耀祖表示， YOHO West 2 期 YOHO West Parkside 第 1B 座中層 B2 室，單位實用面積約 431 方呎，兩房間隔，向西南擁優質景觀，外望中央公園開揚翠綠景色。 伍耀祖指，原叫價 660 萬元，議價後減價 72 萬元或約 10.9% ，以 588 萬元沽出，呎價約 13,643 元。原業主於 2025 年 3 月以 519.1 萬元一手買入單位，持貨約 20 個月轉手，帳面獲利 68.9 萬元，物業期內升值約 13.3% 。</p><p>即睇天水圍 YOHO West 2 期 YOHO West Parkside 放盤 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T07:43:57.794995+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":422,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T23:37:33.971848+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:37:20.745790+00:00","content_hash":"e0ba071141c66f0ca9e14d28da55d4d6dabc75ec85d3304aad8a567b978dfbf1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T07:43:57.794995+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}